{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"228ffc4e51cd04967ca3aa0e94cf0d11a760691d856cffb174a3d459ec9fc93d","ja":"歩の悩み事","zh":"步的烦恼","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2ff5fc5b0a88526c651bb8a7a7b110490fb4f3183f38db78812eb38d2e431097","ja":"う～ん……今年はどうしようかな……。","zh":"嗯～……今年该怎么办呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1972d7e4cbfcaffb9a19af2bbdb93ee3e94b40a7b2568ae6d76d1e1f29715a66","ja":"はいさーい！　あれ？　どうしたの、歩？\n悩み事でもあるの？","zh":"你好啊！咦？怎么了吗，步？\n是有什么烦恼吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5e0049cecbc42afc6435cc396a6bd3f551c353a263a53ef28250bde855e6a797","ja":"ああ、響と可憐か。\n実は年末に実家に帰ろうか悩んでてさ……。","zh":"啊，是响和可怜啊。\n其实我正在烦恼年底要不要回老家呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"10555042a4c2f357ff491ca54adf9814d984b72c205b6d51e585b686bb102b34","ja":"じ、実家に帰るのを悩んでるって……あ、歩さん、\nも、もしかして、アイドルを辞めちゃうんじゃ……！？","zh":"在、在烦恼要不要回老家……步、步小姐，\n该、该不会是要辞掉偶像的工作吧……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"60f0ed7ad350dcf2930c5332630e4e8e0ecf4351a7d197b8d21dc60a5735d917","ja":"そんな～っ！　歩、アイドルを辞めるなんて\nいきなりすぎるぞ！　自分、絶対反対だからね！","zh":"怎么这样～！　步，说要放弃当偶像\n也太突然了吧！　我绝对反对！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"82fc730dd4803a8da2847c575f57c4c3c8cd60c0687d47b5513dbfb13bcb3fb2","ja":"違う！　誤解だって！\nそんなつもりないから！","zh":"不是的！这是误会！\n我完全没那个意思！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4622a902a6bcdb6d94f63c57d1c8a101c2dc987c57e1754cee0322a02c81ea24","ja":"ほっ……よ、よかった～。でも、それならどうして、\n実家へ帰ることを悩んでいるんですか？","zh":"呼……太、太好了～。不过，既然这样，\n您为什么还在烦恼回老家的事情呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"5e0eda9cc3f55a977e5ae1253a28558d548c1339bf534397ef0a570c3ca082fe","ja":"他に帰るのを悩む理由だと……あっ、そうか！\n学校の成績が悪くて、親に見せづらいんだね！","zh":"如果说还有什么不想回去的理由……啊，原来是这样！\n是因为在学校成绩不好，不敢给父母看吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"94d0f61c605a4b0b936ea58b70ae82e2f195b66fefa02ceaa227f0e961e6b1e4","ja":"うんうん。それは、自分にもわかるぞ……。","zh":"嗯嗯。这个我也能明白……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5d5995f38da59b605847ffbdd952a63903055f63d984af1b24e4eaa7dcb7fcd8","ja":"残念。それもハズレ。\nそのへんは……きっとうまくいっているハズだから！","zh":"真遗憾。那个也没中。\n那方面……肯定很顺利的才对！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1cc4bbcc17c7d5e7803cc6e8538d2f9ea607170b01a1533f11d35c94913503f3","ja":"そうなの？　なら、全然わからないぞ……。\nどうして実家に帰るのを悩んでるの？","zh":"是这样吗？那就完全搞不懂了啊……\n你为什么还在为要不要回老家烦恼呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1341.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f55fd4db38d75083065b3840863ca96609760b05fbce11c6c46c1a051fe7eb2b","ja":"えっと、実はさ……。","zh":"那个，其实啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
